/**
 * E4 — project stages + progress reports (T11, US-10/11/12/29/31, plan fase1-golive §E4).
 * Generated by `payload migrate:create e4_progress_reports` (reviewed) + hand-written guards (one
 * migration, run as <prefix>_owner). ADDITIVE / staging-safe: one new table, four new defaulted or
 * nullable columns (projects.progress_pct 0, project_stages.active true,
 * company_settings.sync_progress_reports_enabled true, payload_locked_documents_rels.progress_reports_id);
 * no existing row is rewritten, no column/enum is dropped.
 *
 * Guards (ADR 0006 style, defence in depth behind the domain service):
 * 1. `projects.progress_pct` / `project_stages.progress_pct` change ONLY while the transaction-local
 *    setting `pk.progress_write` = 'on' (set by domain/progress/recalc.ts around its own writes);
 *    anything else → 42501 (requirements §1 #7 "progress hanya lewat laporan"). Range 0..100 CHECKs.
 * 2. `progress_reports`: no DELETE/TRUNCATE for the app role; `received_at` = DB clock and
 *    `editable_until` = received_at + 24 h (requirements §8 T11), no UPDATE after the window;
 *    identity columns immutable; stage must belong to the project; % 0..100 and after ≥ before;
 *    report_date is a business date; photo_count 0..5.
 * 3. `media_progress_photos`: owner link immutable once set; at most 5 photos per report.
 */
